// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 11
window.T11_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"afterward – overdose","cards":[{"w":"afterward","p":"adv.","d":"at a later or subsequent time; after something has happened","c":"後來；之後；隨後","s":"The physical therapy session was very painful at first, but Jerry felt so much better afterward.","t":"物理治療一開始非常痛苦，但傑瑞在之後感覺好多了。"},{"w":"arrest","p":"v.","d":"to seize someone by legal authority and take them into custody","c":"逮捕；拘捕（動詞）","s":"The brave police officers arrested the dangerous suspect for breaking into the jewelry shop downtown.","t":"英勇的警員們因闖入市中心珠寶店而逮捕了危險的嫌疑犯。"},{"w":"arrest","p":"n.","d":"the action of seizing someone to take them into legal custody","c":"逮捕；拘留（可數/不可數）","s":"Detectives worked through the rainy night and finally made an arrest in the serious arson case.","t":"刑警們在雨夜中奮戰，終於在那起嚴重的縱火案中進行了逮捕。"},{"w":"athlete","p":"n.","d":"a person who is proficient in sports and other forms of physical exercise","c":"運動員；體育健兒（可數）","s":"My older brother is a dedicated athlete who practices basketball for three hours every single afternoon.","t":"我的哥哥是一位專注的運動員，每天下午練習籃球長達三個小時。"},{"w":"athletic","p":"adj.","d":"physically strong, fit, and active; relating to athletics","c":"健壯的；運動的；體育的","s":"Because of his tall height and naturally athletic build, David was recruited by the varsity volleyball team.","t":"因為高挑的身材與天生健壯的體格，大衛被校排球隊延攬入隊。"},{"w":"background","p":"n.","d":"a person's education, experience, and social circumstances","c":"背景；經歷；出身（可數/不可數）","s":"During the formal job interview, the manager carefully asked Jason about his educational background.","t":"在正式求職面試中，經理仔細詢問了傑森的教育學歷背景。"},{"w":"background","p":"n.","d":"the part of a picture, scene, or view that lies behind the main objects","c":"背景（景色、音樂等）","s":"The professional wedding photographer captured the bride with a breathtaking blue mountain lake in the background.","t":"專業婚禮攝影師拍下了新娘的照片，背景是一座令人嘆為觀止的蔚藍高山湖泊。"},{"w":"desirable","p":"adj.","d":"wanted or wished for as being attractive, useful, or advantageous","c":"令人嚮往的；稱心的；理想的","s":"Domestic cats are considered highly desirable pets because they are naturally quiet, gentle, and clean indoors.","t":"家貓被認為是極具吸引力且令人嚮往的寵物，因為牠們在室內天生安靜、溫柔且乾淨。"},{"w":"desire","p":"n.","d":"a strong feeling of wanting to have something or wishing for something","c":"渴望；慾望；心願（可數/不可數）","s":"After hiking up the steep rocky trail for seven hours, we had no desire to go out tonight.","t":"在陡峭岩石山徑健行七個小時後，我們今晚完全沒有出門的慾望／意願。"},{"w":"desire","p":"v.","d":"to strongly wish for or want something","c":"渴望；想要（動詞）","s":"Although many ordinary people deeply desire wealth and fame, not everyone is willing to work tirelessly for them.","t":"雖然許多凡人深切渴望名利，但並非每個人都願意為之不知疲倦地奮鬥。"},{"w":"dolphin","p":"n.","d":"a highly intelligent aquatic mammal with a beaklike snout","c":"海豚（可數）","s":"From the wooden deck of our tourist boat, we watched a magnificent pod of wild dolphins jumping gracefully.","t":"從觀光船的木質甲板上，我們看見一群壯麗的野生海豚優雅地跳躍。"},{"w":"donkey","p":"n.","d":"a domesticated hoofed mammal of the horse family with long ears","c":"驢子（可數）","s":"The poor mountain farmer relied heavily on his patient donkey to carry heavy sacks of potatoes to town.","t":"貧困的山區農民非常依賴他那有耐心的驢子把沉重的馬鈴薯袋馱到鎮上。"},{"w":"dose","p":"n.","d":"a measured quantity of a medicine taken at any one time","c":"（藥物）一劑；劑量（可數）","s":"The family doctor clearly instructed the sick patient to take each dose of antibiotic medicine after meals.","t":"家庭醫生清楚指示生病的病患在飯後服用每一劑抗生素藥物。"},{"w":"dose","p":"v.","d":"to administer a dose of medicine to someone","c":"給…服藥；配藥（動詞）","s":"The caring school nurse gently dosed the feverish elementary student with a safe pain reliever before calling her parents.","t":"貼心的校護在通知家長之前，溫柔地給發燒的小學生服下安全的止痛退燒藥。"},{"w":"overdose","p":"n./v.","d":"an excessive and dangerous dose of a drug, or to take such a dose","c":"服藥過量；過量用藥（可數/不可數/動詞）","s":"The young rock musician was rushed to the emergency room after suffering an accidental overdose of sleeping pills.","t":"那位年輕的搖滾樂手因意外服藥過量安眠藥，被緊急送往急診室。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"eager – holy","cards":[{"w":"eager","p":"adj.","d":"wanting very much to do or have something; enthusiastic","c":"渴望的；熱切的；熱心的","s":"Aaron was extremely eager to begin his new job at the technology firm as soon as possible.","t":"亞倫非常熱切渴望盡快在科技公司開始他的新工作。"},{"w":"envy","p":"v.","d":"to feel discontented at someone's luck, success, or possessions","c":"羨慕；嫉妒（動詞）","s":"I am completely content with my modest life and do not envy wealthy celebrities their mansions.","t":"我對自己簡樸的生活感到非常滿足，一點也不羨慕富有名人的豪宅。"},{"w":"envy","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of discontented longing aroused by someone else's possessions","c":"羨慕；嫉妒；令人羨慕的人事物（不可數）","s":"Julia's glossy black hair and glowing complexion were the envy of all the girls in her school.","t":"茱莉亞烏黑光亮的秀髮與紅潤的氣色是全校女孩羨慕的焦點。"},{"w":"envious","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing envy; jealous of someone's advantages","c":"羨慕的；嫉妒的","s":"Although Cindy felt happy for her best friend's promotion, she could not help feeling a little envious.","t":"雖然辛蒂為好友的晉升感到高興，但她忍不住感到有些羨慕。"},{"w":"expressive","p":"adj.","d":"effectively conveying thought, feeling, or meaning","c":"富於表情的；意味深長的；善於表達的","s":"Kelly has such an expressive face that it conveys all her inner emotions vividly without saying a single word.","t":"凱莉擁有一張表情極為豐富的臉龐，無須一言一語便能生動傳達所有內心情感。"},{"w":"fancy","p":"adj.","d":"elaborate in structure or decoration; expensive and sophisticated","c":"精緻奢華的；華麗的；高級的","s":"Bill took Martha to a very fancy French restaurant downtown and asked her to marry him.","t":"比爾帶瑪莎去市中心一家非常高級奢華的法國餐廳向她求婚。"},{"w":"fancy","p":"v.","d":"to feel a desire for; to want or like; to imagine","c":"想要；愛慕；自詡為（動詞）","s":"Do you fancy having a warm cup of herbal tea with a slice of chocolate cake this afternoon?","t":"你今天下午想要來杯溫熱的草本茶配上一塊巧克力蛋糕嗎？"},{"w":"take a fancy to","p":"v.phr.","d":"to develop a sudden liking or affection for someone or something","c":"喜歡上；看中；對…產生好感","s":"During her summer trip to Tokyo, Donna suddenly took a fancy to Japanese noodles and ramen.","t":"在東京的夏季旅行中，唐娜突然喜歡上了日本麵條與拉麵。"},{"w":"gesture","p":"n.","d":"a movement of part of the body to express an idea or meaning; an action performed for effect","c":"手勢；姿勢；表示；姿態（可數）","s":"Dustin offered to help me wash the dirty dishes after dinner, which was a very thoughtful gesture.","t":"達斯汀在晚餐後主動幫我清洗髒盤子，這是一個非常貼心的舉動／心意表示。"},{"w":"gesture","p":"v.","d":"to make a movement of the hands or body to express meaning","c":"做手勢；用手勢示意（動詞）","s":"Because the restaurant was noisy, Tina gestured to the busy waiter that she was ready to pay her bill.","t":"因為餐廳很吵鬧，蒂娜用手勢向忙碌的服務生示意她準備要結帳了。"},{"w":"heap","p":"n.","d":"an untidy collection of things piled up together","c":"一堆；許多（可數）","s":"The gardener raked the backyard and left a large heap of dry leaves under the old oak tree.","t":"園丁耙掃了後院，在老橡樹下留下了大一堆乾樹葉。"},{"w":"heap","p":"v.","d":"to put things into a large pile; to give a great deal of praise or blame","c":"堆積；大量給予（讚美、責備）（動詞）","s":"The proud dinner table was heaped high with roasted turkey, fresh mashed potatoes, and sweet corn.","t":"豐盛的餐桌上堆滿了烤火雞、新鮮馬鈴薯泥與甜玉米。"},{"w":"heater","p":"n.","d":"a device for warming the air or water in a room or building","c":"暖氣機；暖爐；加熱器（可數）","s":"Because the winter night was turning chilly, my mother decided to turn on the electric heater in the living room.","t":"因為冬夜逐漸變冷，我母親決定打開客廳裡的電暖氣機。"},{"w":"holy","p":"adj.","d":"dedicated or consecrated to God or a religious purpose; sacred","c":"神聖的；聖潔的","s":"Thousands of faithful pilgrims travel across high mountains to visit this holy temple every single year.","t":"數千名虔誠的朝聖者每年跋山涉水前來參拜這座神聖的寺廟。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"leap – paradise","cards":[{"w":"leap","p":"v.","d":"to jump or spring a long way, to a great height, or with great force","c":"跳躍；躍過；跳入（動詞）","s":"The graceful white horse easily leaped over the wooden fence and galloped across the open meadow.","t":"那匹優雅的白馬輕巧地躍過木柵欄，在開闊的草地上奔馳。"},{"w":"leap","p":"n.","d":"a forceful jump or spring; a dramatic increase or transition","c":"跳躍；劇增；巨變（可數）","s":"With a dramatic flying leap, the energetic sheepdog snatched the colorful plastic Frisbee out of the air.","t":"伴隨著戲劇性的凌空一躍，精力充沛的牧羊犬在半空中咬住了色彩繽紛的塑膠飛盤。"},{"w":"lettuce","p":"n.","d":"a cultivated plant with large green leaves, eaten raw in salads","c":"萵苣；生菜（不可數/可數）","s":"The chef served the grilled garlic shrimp beautifully on a fresh bed of crisp green lettuce.","t":"主廚將烤蒜香蝦精美地擺放在一層新鮮酥脆的綠色萵苣底鋪上。"},{"w":"lily","p":"n.","d":"a bulbous plant with large, trumpet-shaped, typically fragrant flowers","c":"百合花（可數）","s":"Tourists gathered quietly around the calm pond to admire the beautiful pink water lilies floating peacefully.","t":"遊客們靜靜聚集在平靜的池塘周圍，欣賞安詳漂浮的美麗粉紅睡蓮／百合。"},{"w":"lively","p":"adj.","d":"full of life and energy; active, enthusiastic, and animated","c":"活潑的；充滿生氣的；熱烈的","s":"The cheerful accordion music created such a lively atmosphere that all the guests wanted to dance.","t":"歡快的手風琴音樂營造出了如此充滿生氣且熱鬧的氛圍，以至於所有客人都想跳舞。"},{"w":"loaf","p":"n.","d":"a shaped mass of bread baked in one piece (pl. loaves)","c":"一條（麵包）；一塊（可數）","s":"Early every Saturday morning, my father visits the corner bakery to buy a warm loaf of sourdough bread.","t":"每週六清晨，我父親都會去街角的麵包店買一條剛出爐的酸種麵包。"},{"w":"loaf","p":"v.","d":"to spend time idly; to lounge about doing nothing","c":"虛度光陰；遊手好閒；晃蕩（動詞）","s":"Instead of completing his homework or tidying his messy bedroom, Sam spent the whole afternoon loafing around.","t":"山姆沒有完成作業或整理凌亂的臥室，而是整個下午都在閒晃虛度光陰。"},{"w":"necessity","p":"n.","d":"the fact of being required or indispensable; an essential thing","c":"必然性；必要原則；必需品（可數/不可數）","s":"Clean drinking water, warm shelter, and nutritious food are considered absolute necessities for human survival.","t":"乾淨的飲用水、溫暖的住所與有營養的食物被認為是人類生存的絕對必需品。"},{"w":"occasion","p":"n.","d":"a particular time or event; a special or formal event","c":"場合；時刻；重要活動；盛會（可數）","s":"The university graduation ceremony was an occasion of tremendous joy and pride for all families.","t":"大學畢業典禮對所有家庭而言都是一個充滿無比喜悅與自豪的盛大場合／活動。"},{"w":"occasional","p":"adj.","d":"occurring, appearing, or done seldom and irregularly","c":"偶爾的；不常的","s":"Apart from an occasional heavy rain shower, the autumn weather on the island remained mostly sunny and dry.","t":"除了一場偶爾的強陣雨之外，島上的秋天天氣大部分時間保持晴朗乾燥。"},{"w":"paradise","p":"n.","d":"an ideal or idyllic place; heaven in Christian and religious belief","c":"樂園；天堂；樂土（不可數/可數）","s":"With its turquoise sea waters, white sandy beaches, and swaying palms, the Caribbean island is a tropical paradise.","t":"擁有綠松石般的清澈海水、白沙灘與搖曳棕櫚樹，這座加勒比海島嶼宛如一個熱帶人間仙境／樂園。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"plastic – rough","cards":[{"w":"plastic","p":"n.","d":"a synthetic material made from polymers, shaped when soft and hardened","c":"塑膠；塑膠製品（不可數/可數）","s":"These lightweight waterproof boots are ideal for rainy weather because they are made of durable plastic.","t":"這些輕巧防水的靴子非常適合雨天，因為它們是由耐用的塑膠製成的。"},{"w":"plastic","p":"adj.","d":"made of plastic; easily shaped or molded","c":"塑膠的；可塑的；做作不自然的","s":"Environmental activists urged the public to stop purchasing drinking water sold in disposable plastic bottles.","t":"環保人士敦促大眾停止購買用拋棄式塑膠瓶裝的飲用水。"},{"w":"preparation","p":"n.","d":"the action or process of making ready or being made ready","c":"準備；籌備；預備工作（可數/不可數）","s":"Dedicated restaurant waiters set all the wooden tables and polished glasses in preparation for the evening dinner rush.","t":"敬業的餐廳服務生擺好了所有木桌並擦亮玻璃杯，為晚間用餐高峰做準備。"},{"w":"producer","p":"n.","d":"a person or company that makes goods or oversees the production of films/music","c":"製作人；生產者；製造商（可數）","s":"Rick was the brilliant music producer behind many of the most successful pop records of the 1990s.","t":"瑞克是1990年代許多最成功的流行唱片背後才華橫溢的音樂製作人。"},{"w":"rate","p":"n.","d":"a measure, quantity, or frequency; a fixed price charged for something","c":"比率；速率；費率；價格（可數）","s":"Because the national central bank decided to lower the baseline interest rate, borrowing money became significantly cheaper.","t":"因為國家中央銀行決定降低基準利率，借貸資金變得明顯便宜得多。"},{"w":"rate","p":"v.","d":"to assign a standard, value, or ranking to someone or something","c":"評估；評價；名列（動詞）","s":"On a scale of one to ten, most satisfied hotel guests rate the cleanliness and friendly service as a nine.","t":"在一到十分的等級中，大多數滿意的飯店房客將清潔度與親切服務評定為九分。"},{"w":"relax","p":"v.","d":"to make or become less tense, anxious, or rigid; to rest","c":"放鬆；休息；緩和；放寬（動詞）","s":"After jogging through the scenic botanical park for an hour, Maggie sat quietly on the bench to relax.","t":"在風景秀麗的植物公園慢跑一個小時後，麥琪安靜地坐在長凳上放鬆休息。"},{"w":"remote","p":"adj.","d":"situated far from the main centers of population; distant in connection","c":"偏僻的；遙遠的；微乎其微的","s":"The brave volunteer doctors traveled across rough rivers to provide healthcare to families living in remote mountain villages.","t":"英勇的志工醫生涉水渡過險峻河流，為生活在偏僻山村的家庭提供醫療服務。"},{"w":"roar","p":"v.","d":"to make a full, deep, prolonged cry; to move making a loud noise","c":"吼叫；咆哮；轟鳴疾馳（動詞）","s":"The fierce male lion roared loudly inside its enclosure, causing frightened zoo visitors to take several steps back.","t":"那隻兇猛的雄獅在圍欄內大聲咆哮吼叫，讓驚恐的動物園遊客退後了好幾步。"},{"w":"roar","p":"n.","d":"a full, deep, prolonged cry uttered by a lion or person; a loud sound","c":"吼聲；轟鳴聲；呼嘯（可數）","s":"The politician tried hard to speak into the microphone, but his voice was drowned out by the deafening roar of the crowd.","t":"那位政客努力對著麥克風講話，但他的聲音被人群震耳欲聾的呼喊歡呼聲所淹沒。"},{"w":"rough","p":"adj.","d":"having an uneven or irregular surface; harsh, violent, or approximate","c":"粗糙的；狂風暴雨的；粗略的；艱困的","s":"Before submitting the final architectural project, the young student drew a rough draft of his floor design.","t":"在提交最終建築專案之前，那名年輕學生畫了一份他樓層設計的初稿／草稿。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"scientific – surroundings","cards":[{"w":"scientific","p":"adj.","d":"based on or characterized by the methods and principles of science","c":"科學的；符合科學原則的","s":"Many rigorous scientific studies have been carried out to explore the severe impacts of climate change on ocean ecosystems.","t":"許多嚴謹的科學研究已經展開，探討氣候變遷對海洋生態系統的嚴重衝擊。"},{"w":"scientist","p":"n.","d":"a person who is studying or has expert knowledge of one or more of the natural sciences","c":"科學家（可數）","s":"A dedicated team of international scientists worked tirelessly in the laboratory to develop an effective vaccine.","t":"一支敬業的國際科學家團隊在實驗室裡不知疲倦地工作，以研發出有效的疫苗。"},{"w":"seal","p":"n.","d":"a fish-eating aquatic mammal with flippers; an embossed emblem used as evidence of authenticity","c":"海豹；封條；印章；圖章（可數）","s":"The ancient royal proclamation bore the official golden seal of the reigning British monarch.","t":"這份古老的皇家公告帶有現任英國君主的官方金色印章／印信。"},{"w":"seal","p":"v.","d":"to fasten or close securely; to finalize an agreement","c":"封閉；密封；確定；締結（動詞）","s":"After several rounds of tough negotiations, the two company executives shook hands to seal the multimillion-dollar deal.","t":"經過數輪艱難談判後，兩位公司高階主管握手敲定／締結了這筆數百萬美元的交易。"},{"w":"sigh","p":"v.","d":"to emit a long, deep, audible breath expressing sadness, relief, or tiredness","c":"嘆氣；嘆息（動詞）","s":"Looking at the endless mountain of paperwork on his office desk, Gary sighed heavily and grabbed his coffee.","t":"看著辦公桌上堆積如山的文件，蓋瑞沉重地嘆了一口氣，拿起了他的咖啡。"},{"w":"sigh","p":"n.","d":"a long, deep, audible breath expressing tiredness, grief, or relief","c":"嘆息；嘆氣聲（可數）","s":"Concerned parents let out a collective sigh of relief when the school announced that all students were safe.","t":"當學校宣布所有學生平安無事時，憂心忡忡的家長們齊齊發出了一聲如釋重負的嘆息。"},{"w":"slender","p":"adj.","d":"gracefully thin, slim, or delicate; small in degree or amount","c":"苗條纖細的；修長的；微薄的","s":"Catherine maintained a graceful and remarkably slender figure throughout her long career as a classical ballet dancer.","t":"凱瑟琳在漫長的古典芭蕾舞生涯中，始終保持著優雅而極其苗條纖細的身材。"},{"w":"surround","p":"v.","d":"to be all around someone or something; to encircle","c":"包圍；環繞；圍住（動詞）","s":"The charming country cottage is completely surrounded by tall green pine trees and colorful wild rose bushes.","t":"那座迷人的鄉間小屋被高大的綠色松樹和色彩繽紛的野玫瑰灌木完全環繞包圍著。"},{"w":"surroundings","p":"n.","d":"the things and conditions around a person or thing; environment","c":"周圍環境；周遭事物（複數名詞）","s":"When moving to an unfamiliar foreign country, it usually takes several months to adapt to your new surroundings.","t":"搬到一個陌生的外國時，通常需要幾個月的時間來適應你的新周遭環境。"}]}];
